       "senator": "dean-g-skelos",
       "text": "Mr. President, this bill amends the General Obligations Law by returning the assumption of risk doctrine to civil lawsuits. In an action for damages, if the defendant shows that the injury sustained by the plaintiff arose during the commission or attempted commission by the…"
      },
